{"id":"0658bc4d05a67866","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-zorn-inductive-poset.md","title":"ZFC Zorn Inductive Poset","display":"df-zfc-zorn-inductive-poset — ZFC Zorn Inductive Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-zorn-inductive-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-zorn-inductive-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-zorn-inductive-poset — ZFC Zorn Inductive Poset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-zorn-inductive-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-zorn-inductive-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-zorn-inductive-poset — ZFC Zorn Inductive Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-chain.md\">../batch17/58-df-chain.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,R\\in V\">\\(P,R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,R)\\)</span> (chain predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-chain.md\">../batch17/58-df-chain.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZornInductivePoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZornInductivePoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZornInductivePoset}_S(P,R) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land \\forall C\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,R)\\to \\exists u\\in P\\;\\forall c\\in C\\;(\\langle c,u\\rangle\\in R))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}zorn\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZornInductivePoset}_S(P,R) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land \\forall C\\subseteq P\\;(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,R)\\to \\exists u\\in P\\;\\forall c\\in C\\;(\\langle c,u\\rangle\\in R))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every chain in the declared poset has an upper bound in its carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"